Photorealistic sprite sheet of vintage vacuum-tube audio music notes, viewed perfectly straight-on, isolated on a pure flat black background (#000000). Exactly six separate musical note objects arranged in a single evenly spaced horizontal row, none touching, each fully visible with generous black margin around it, all aligned to the same baseline and uniform height: 1. a single eighth note with flag, 2. two beamed eighth notes, 3. a single quarter note, 4. two beamed sixteenth notes with double beam, 5. a half note with hollow note head, 6. a single sixteenth note with double flag. Each note is formed of warm luminous glowing golden-amber vacuum tube filaments with glowing warm amber-orange heads, resembling vintage valve amplifier indicator filaments. Consistent style and warm glow across all six notes. Ultra crisp focus, pure solid black background. Absolutely no staff lines, no grid lines, no text, no numbers, no frames, no watermark.
